                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.6363/2480: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Mexico</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Schoenfeld</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-01-13T15:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 13,
                                1928—3 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>12. Your telegrams Nos. 23, January 12, noon, and 24, January 12, 2 p.m. The
                    Department is giving a statement to the press based upon the above-mentioned
                    telegrams.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
